{"id":"H2321","lemma":"חֹ֫דֶשׁ","transliteration":"chodesh","sayIt":"CHO-desh","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hodesh","meaning":"A womanof the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.9; married to Shaharaim (H7842);\nmother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Jeuz (H3263), Sachia (H7634) and Mirmah (H4821)\n§ Hodesh = \"new moon\"\nthe wife of Shaharaim, a Benjamite","glosses":["hodesh"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hodesh","kjv":"of Hodesh"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:9","note":"By Hodesh his wife, he became the father of Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7842","lemma":"שַׁחֲרַ֫יִם","transliteration":"shacharayim","gloss":"Shaharaim"},{"id":"H3103","lemma":"יוֹבָב","transliteration":"yovav","gloss":"Jobab"},{"id":"H6644","lemma":"צִבְיָא","transliteration":"tsivya","gloss":"Zibia"},{"id":"H4331","lemma":"מֵישָׁא","transliteration":"mesah","gloss":"Mesha"},{"id":"H4445","lemma":"מַלְכָּם","transliteration":"malkam","gloss":"Malcam"},{"id":"H3263","lemma":"יְעוּץ","transliteration":"yeuts","gloss":"Jeuz"},{"id":"H7634","lemma":"שָֽׂכְיָה","transliteration":"shovyah","gloss":"Sachia"},{"id":"H4821","lemma":"מִרְמָה","transliteration":"mirmah","gloss":"Mirmah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}